Error [E0202]: `&` needs a plain named binding after it
  --> tests/ui/write_index_argument_teaches_range_window.jet:7:11
    |
  7 |     edit(&values[0])
    |           ^^^^^^
 Why: write access (`&`) can only be granted to a named binding, not an expression
 Fix: change the helper to accept a list window, then pass a range write window such as `&xs[a..b]`
